  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341222",
      "title": "Adding User Logout",
      "lectureOrder": 223,
      "videoOrder": 208,
      "sourceHash": "c99b1c0b04ed40df6f03658955d8205b4a40ee1e73119839c0206c31edc99908",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "Now to make this logout button work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "we need to add a new Server Action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "So I'll go to my auth-actions.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 13.14,
          "en": "and in there I'll export a new async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.14,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "which I'll name logout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "and that function should do what the name suggests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "Now, before we continue working on that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "I'll go to the auth.js file though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 27.72,
          "en": "where I have all that Lucia authentication related code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 30.84,
          "en": "because I also want to add a new function there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.84,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "a function called destroySession,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "because that's in the end what I want to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "when I log a user out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 42.57,
          "en": "it means that we want to destroy the session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.57,
          "end": 45.003,
          "en": "and the session cookie for that user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 48.51,
          "en": "Now, how do we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.51,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "Well, we can start by checking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 54.36,
          "en": "whether the user has a valid session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 57.693,
          "en": "So we can call verifyAuth here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 61.71,
          "en": "and we'll get back this result object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.71,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "which has a user and a session key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "at least if we await this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 71.25,
          "en": "since verifyAuth actually returns a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.25,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "But then we get a session and a user key here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 75.903,
          "en": "And I'm interested in a session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "Because if here I find that we don't have a session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 85.68,
          "en": "I know that there was no session cookie to begin with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.68,
          "end": 89.61,
          "en": "and in that case, we can return an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.61,
          "end": 93.72999999999999,
          "en": "where we could say unauthorized in some error key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.03999999999999,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "because something went wrong here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 99.93299999999999,
          "en": "We could also throw an error, alternatively.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.92,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "If we make it past this if check though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 105.84,
          "en": "we know that we did have a session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.84,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "and we had a valid session as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 112.413,
          "en": "but now I want to invalidate it and destroy the cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 117.31,
          "en": "Therefore, we should call lucia.invalidateSession",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.22999999999999,
          "end": 123.23,
          "en": "and pass our session ID to that method and await that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 126.36,
          "en": "That will under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "reach out to that session's database table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "and delete the session from there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 135.723,
          "en": "so that we forget the fact that this user was logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 140.37,
          "en": "In addition, we should also clear that session cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "and we did that before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "Here, we want to create a blank session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "and then set it so that we effectively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 150.393,
          "en": "get rid of that session cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.86,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "And that's all that should happen when we destroy a session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 158.844,
          "en": "we should delete it from the database in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.844,
          "end": 160.773,
          "en": "and clear that cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 164.91,
          "en": "So now with that destroySession function added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.91,
          "end": 168.54,
          "en": "we can go back to our auth-actions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "and in that logout action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 173.94,
          "en": "we can and should now call this newly added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.94,
          "end": 177.603,
          "en": "destroySession function and await it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 183.15,
          "en": "And then we can and should redirect the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.15,
          "end": 184.98,
          "en": "and redirect to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.98,
          "end": 188.49,
          "en": "so to the log-in page, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.49,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "Well, and with that, we can now use this logout action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 195.75,
          "en": "in our layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.75,
          "end": 198.84,
          "en": "the auth specific layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 203.68,
          "en": "and assign the logout action as a action to this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 209.85,
          "en": "so that this logout button will trigger this action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.85,
          "end": 213.32999999999998,
          "en": "For that, of course, you must import this logout action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.32999999999998,
          "end": 216.99,
          "en": "and if you then do that and you save that and reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.99,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "and you are logged in, if you click logout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 221.583,
          "en": "you see, I'm redirected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.63,
          "end": 226.8,
          "en": "And if I now try to access /training, that will fail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 226.8,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "and I'm continuously redirected here to the login page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 233.403,
          "en": "because that session cookie was destroyed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.42000000000002,
          "end": 237.48,
          "en": "And I have for now have to log in again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 239.13,
          "en": "to view that page again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 241.773,
          "en": "And then of course we can also log out again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.359,
          "end": 245.76,
          "en": "and that's how we can implement authentication",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.76,
          "end": 248.223,
          "en": "with NextJS and Lucia.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
